    "text": "Look at this photo taken by @soph-astro.esa.int. What did you spot first?\n\nThe Moon? The clouds? Or that thin blue glow along the edge?\n\nThat glow is the atmosphere. All of it. Everyone you know lives inside that line.",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/esa.int/post/3n3bt7uc2ek2d",
    "image": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:yqfmy2p54vqgekrcz5zzykhl/bafkreidnbqcgognu3ryvdesjvvpxayfhte3hzj6mwgbiobdzgz74rzaupm",
