    "text": "Rocket Lab  has launched their Electron Rocket on the “Night Owls Never Sleep” mission lifting off from Launch Complex 1B (LC-1B) on the Māhia Peninsula, New Zealand\nOn board today's mission was another StriX-9 imaging satellite, the 14th launch for Japan's Synspective.\n🎥 Rocket Lab",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3n3awepjwwc2w",
    "image": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Ayifpqamzwvp3g4szr44mz37r/bafkreiblpf56jo7jswmgukpjags3brgp2ej3buso7ymxodpfu6xhq23sre/thumbnail.jpg",
