    "text": "In a historic move, the Federal Communications Commission has authorized SpaceX to launch 1,000,000 AI satellites.\n\nFor context, the entire world has only launched 28,808 satellites since Sputnik in 1957.\n\nSpaceX wants to launch 34x that in 14 years... and it's all for Grok? → youtu.be/JF-GzKtDGzY",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3n3asdp33322o",
